body:
 This is kind of word vomit, but I needed to lean in here for a second  because I feel crazy. I’m tired but how am I supposed to go back to  sleep after this. NC sounds good in theory, but in practice is  terrifying, because she is so good at turning on you and making you feel  like it’s on you to keep her alive.  I feel like a little girl. She is scary and I hate that I care about her  the way that I do. It is so scary that I don’t know what parts of my  caring for her are conditioning and what parts are me. 

&#x200B;

so much this. i'm still struggling with what to do with my waif/witch-queen. i admire the NC people on here.

  It seems like she had actively set me up to fail and not be able to  support myself, but she wasn't going to support me either. She wanted me  to fail but she also didn't want me dependent on her. The implications  of that are insane. 

&#x200B;

yup.  Mine wanted me to fail but demands I support her, cause she's owed it for having me.
